title: 'spec-msg: emit Provides and synthesize Requires in PVF'
doc:
- audience: Runtime Dev
  description: |-
    Emits `UMPSignal::Provides` from SPMS header digests and synthesizes `UMPSignal::Requires` in `validate_block` via `Config::ConsumptionRecordSource` and `ParachainBlockData::V3`.
    A malformed or duplicate SPMS item in any header invalidates the candidate.
    Signed overrides replace only the scheduling signals the blocks emitted, in their original order, and reject duplicate scheduling signals.
    Collators skip candidates whose signals fail validation.
    Every `cumulus_pallet_parachain_system::Config` must set `ConsumptionRecordSource`. Use `()` to disable V3 PoVs.
    Upgrade parachain nodes to support V3 PoV recovery before enabling the format.
    Before the parachain emits either signal, deploy validator nodes that decode `Provides` and `Requires` and the relay runtime that checks `Requires` (#13906), then collators that append `Provides` and supply lifts in V3 PoVs.
